  sources:
  - name: DATA COLLECTION_Longmont_2024_GHG_Inventory
    authority: City of Longmont
    url:
    description: "A later version of the 2024 inventory (last saved 2025-07-27). It
      has three sheets that the March 2025 SharePoint original lacks. 'On-Road Data_NEW'
      is Francie's and authoritative: it is the origin of the 2024 VMT (Google EIE
      trip distances) and the 2024 transport factors. 'datasets' is Kausal's (Jouni
      Tuomisto): values copied by hand from the other sheets, not referenced, so it
      is never an origin. 'Sheet1' is hidden; it holds VMT working (HPMS breakdown,
      registered vehicles by type and fuel, vehicle MPG with sources), not primary
      data. Migrated from kausal-paths/data/longmont on 2026-11-13.; Attachment: client/DATA
      COLLECTION_Longmont_2024_GHG_Inventory.xlsx; Format: .xlsx; Date Last Updated:
      2025-07-27"
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Longmont 2024 GHG Inventory (city original, March 2025)
    authority: City of Longmont (last saved by Francie Jaffe, 2025-03-25)
    url:
    description: "The 2024 community inventory as it was on the city's SharePoint,
      without the sheets added later for Paths. It is the original for the 2024 values:
      stationary energy, aviation, transit, railways, waste and recycling, IPPU and
      the GWPs. Sent by Francie Jaffe (City of Longmont); the date is when the file
      was last saved, which approximates when Kausal received it. Years covered: 2016-2024.;
      Attachment: client/Longmont (CO) Client/2025 Paths Update/From Longmont_s Sharepoint
      Folder 020242025/DATA COLLECTION_Longmont_2024_GHG_Inventory.xlsx; Format: .xlsx;
      Geographic Coverage: City of Longmont, Colorado; Date Last Updated: 2025-03-25;
      Updated by: Jouni Tuomisto (register row drafted by Claude, 2026-11-21)"
    edition:
    target: data_point
  dataset:
    time_resolution: yearly
    is_editable: true
  index_columns:
  - energy_carrier
  - ghg
  - Year
  updated_at: '1795525998'
  units:
    fuel_emission_factor: t/gal
